<title>UK: UK's OFT extends Airtours' Italy buy review.</title>
<headline>UK's OFT extends Airtours' Italy buy review.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said on Wednesday it extended the review period for Airtours Plc's and Carnival Corp's planned acquisition of Costa Crociere SpA until April 25.</p>
<p>The regulatory agency said it had extended the period of consideration for the deal by 15 working days.</p>
<p>In December, British holiday operator Airtours and its U.S. partner, Carnival, said they planned to buy the Italian cruise line for about 181 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
